      "semantics": [
        "对应参考语句 x = F.hardsigmoid(x)，计算 y = clamp(x + 3, 0, 6) / 6，逐元素，保持 shape、stride、dtype。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "custom_instance_norm2d_no_affine",
      "parameters": [
        {
          "name": "x",
          "kind": "tensor",
          "dtype": "torch.float32",
          "device": "cuda",
          "shape": "[16, 3, 1024, 1024]",
          "layout": "supports strides",
          "nullable": false,
          "optional": false
        },
        {
          "name": "eps",
          "kind": "float",
          "optional": false,
          "nullable": false
        }
      ],
      "returns": {
        "type": "tensor",
        "dtype": "torch.float32",
        "device": "cuda",
        "shape": "same as x"
      },
      "semantics": [
        "对应参考语句 x = self.norm(x)。InstanceNorm2d 无 affine，对每个 (N,C) 计算该实例所有空间位置 HW 的均值与方差（有偏，除以 HW），然后 (x - mean) / sqrt(var + eps)。输入为 4D [N,C,H,W]，输出同 shape/dtype。"
      ]
