  "reference_steps": [
    {
      "checkpoint": "step_001",
      "source": "x = F.hardsigmoid(x)",
      "semantics": [
        "对输入张量逐元素计算 hard sigmoid：clamp(x + 3, 0, 6) / 6，输出 shape 与输入相同，float32 CUDA。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "checkpoint": "step_002",
      "source": "x = self.norm(x)",
      "semantics": [
        "InstanceNorm2d 无 affine、无 running stats，对每个样本每个通道，使用其空间位置 H*W 的均值和方差归一化：(x - mean) / sqrt(var + eps)，方差使用有偏估计。输出 shape 与输入相同，float32 CUDA。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "checkpoint": "step_003",
      "source": "return x",
      "semantics": [
        "最终返回 step_002 的归一化结果，shape [16,3,1024,1024]，float32 CUDA。"
      ]
    }
  ]
